---
import AppLayout from '../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
import { openEvoScientificState } from '../../lib/openEvoScientificState';
const seedRepo = 'https://github.com/mykcs/seed3090';
const currentRepo = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment';
---
<AppLayout title="RTX6 复现记录（历史）" description="2026-08-12 的 RTX6 / 4×RTX3090 复现运行手册已转为历史记录；实时 OpenEvo 状态由 openevo-experiment 实际工作分支的 current-campaign 与最新 reconciliation/result 决定。" locale="zh">
  <div class="shell editorial-page historical-runbook">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="section-kicker">历史运行手册 · 2026-08-12</span>
      <h1>RTX6 复现记录</h1>
      <p class="lede">这条路线记录了旧 RTX6（4×RTX3090）时期的 SEED / OpenEvo 环境准备与小规模验证。它仍有复现和迁移价值，但不再代表当前实验环境。</p>
    </header>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="historical-platform-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">历史平台</span><h2 id="historical-platform-title">RTX6 · 4×RTX3090</h2></div></div>
      <dl class="runbook-facts"><div><dt>用途</dt><dd>WebShop / ALFWorld bring-up、离线依赖、早期参数实验</dd></div><div><dt>仓库</dt><dd><code>seed3090</code></dd></div><div><dt>保留证据</dt><dd>日志、失败轨迹、preflight、Stage-1 检查器</dd></div><div><dt>状态</dt><dd>历史，不再启动新实验</dd></div></dl>
      <div class="links"><a class="button button-secondary" href={seedRepo} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">seed3090 ↗</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/guides/seed-4x3090-preflight.sh">历史 preflight</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/guides/seed-stage1-check.py">Stage-1 检查器</a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="current-platform-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">实时状态入口</span><h2 id="current-platform-title">openevo-experiment · branch-aware</h2></div></div>
      <p>新的代码、Run Manifest、campaign 和科学结论只在 <code>openevo-experiment</code> 继续。本站在 <time datetime={openEvoScientificState.checkedAt}>{openEvoScientificState.checkedAt}</time> 核验默认 <code>main</code>：<code>current-campaign.json</code> 记录的是 <strong>{openEvoScientificState.defaultBranchSnapshot.phase}</strong>，状态 <code>{openEvoScientificState.defaultBranchSnapshot.status}</code>。这只是带日期的默认分支快照；活跃科学分支可能更靠前。</p>
      <p>{openEvoScientificState.liveStateRule.zh} {openEvoScientificState.gpuRule.zh}</p>
      <div class="links"><a class="button button-secondary" href={currentRepo} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">openevo-experiment ↗</a><a class="button button-secondary" href={openEvoScientificState.currentCampaignUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">default main current-campaign ↗</a><a class="button button-primary" href={localePath('zh','/research/seed-openevo/study/run/')}>当前复现指南 →</a><a class="button button-secondary" href={localePath('zh','/research/seed-openevo/study/results/')}>实验状态与历史结果</a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="migration-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">迁移</span><h2 id="migration-title">历史材料的用途</h2></div></div>
      <div class="archive-grid"><article><strong>环境经验</strong><span>保留离线依赖、WebShop / ALFWorld 安装和失败诊断经验。</span></article><article><strong>实验证据</strong><span>保留 4×3090 上的真实 rollout 与早期 SD-LoRA 结果，作为历史对照。</span></article><article><strong>新实验开发</strong><span>openevo-experiment 负责新的代码、Run Manifest、campaign 和科学结论。</span></article></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</AppLayout>

<style>
.runbook-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.6rem;margin:0}.runbook-facts div{padding:.85rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px}.runbook-facts dt{color:var(--muted);font-size:.68rem}.runbook-facts dd{margin:.3rem 0 0;font-size:.8rem}.links{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1rem}.section>p{max-width:78ch;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}.archive-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.6rem}.archive-grid article{padding:.85rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px}.archive-grid strong,.archive-grid span{display:block}.archive-grid span{margin-top:.35rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.74rem;line-height:1.45}@media(max-width:700px){.runbook-facts,.archive-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
